Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.73,0:00:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What should I do, Kotori?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.31,0:00:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not so sure myself.\NThis is a bit unexpected.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.95,0:00:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, anime and manga characters\Nare ideal companions, in a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.83,0:00:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,When you compare them to real people,\Nreality seems like a letdown.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.04,0:00:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Speaking from experience?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.71,0:00:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Tsk, tsk, tsk. I fancy\Nvoice actresses, too, Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.17,0:00:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay then.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.80,0:00:38.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander. Didn't Nia say\Nshe liked some character?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.89,0:00:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Tokiya. Girls seem to love him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.60,0:00:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.64,0:00:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Shido, help is on the way.\NJust follow my plan to the word.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.86,0:00:55.07,Default,,0,0,0,,He's taking forever.\NStrategizing with Kotori, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.07,0:00:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, there you are--
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.67,0:02:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Tokiya.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.05,0:02:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,From {\i1}Chronicle{\i}?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.80,0:02:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That costume's legit!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.26,0:02:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,This seat's mine, woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.43,0:02:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Tokiya...? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.27,0:02:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Mind yourself, woman.\NI didn't say you can use my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.07,0:03:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Back off, woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.95,0:03:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Happiness climbing!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.45,0:03:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Sealing levels reached.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.66,0:03:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It worked, Shido! Go for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.87,0:03:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.59,0:03:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.26,0:03:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,As if!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.80,0:03:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.14,0:03:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Happiness falling!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.60,0:03:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It's lower than ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.43,0:03:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No way! Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.02,0:03:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell were you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.61,0:03:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Meaning?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.77,0:03:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Tokiya would never make moves\Non a woman! Use common sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.82,0:03:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Common sense?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.36,0:03:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Tokiya's on a journey to avenge\Nhis little sister and lover, Hibari!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.95,0:03:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,As a lonely observer, I wouldn't dare\Nintrude on that beautiful world!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.46,0:03:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't break the fourth wall!\NDon't break it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.42,0:04:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Calm down, Nia!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.84,0:04:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Tokiya would never do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.93,0:04:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,If you wanna make me fall for you,\Ncome back when you're 2D!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.60,0:04:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that didn't work out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.39,0:04:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my. You sure took a beating.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.69,0:04:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And who's fault is that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.90,0:04:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander. The plan failed,\Nbut it's true that her levels rose.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.78,0:04:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Precisely.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.28,0:04:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, if a character\Nshe likes is brought to life,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.16,0:04:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,it's possible to raise her happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.46,0:04:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,So, 2.5D will work.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.34,0:04:42.67,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case...!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.97,0:04:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Was that a bit cruel of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.89,0:04:55.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess ditching him there\Nwasn't the nicest thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.27,0:04:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I should've let him kiss me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.15,0:05:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Though, Spirit power can't be sealed\Nunless you open your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.44,0:05:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He seems like a good guy,\Nbut 3D doesn't do it for me...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.91,0:05:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Argh! What the hell should I do?!\NJust tell me, Raziel!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.38,0:05:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.42,0:05:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello. Delivery.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.30,0:05:32.06,On Top,,0,0,0,,"Demo"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.18,0:05:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,"As thanks for your services,\Nwe've sent you a demo of a new game."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.27,0:05:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? Have I done work\Nfor this company before?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.19,0:05:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like a school-based {\i1}otome{\i} game.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.45,0:05:49.95,On Top,,0,0,0,,"Please input your name..."\N"Back | OK"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.32,0:05:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Nia... Honjo...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.20,0:05:55.87,OS,,0,0,0,,"Birthday: 2/29\NNia Honjo"\N"Back | OK"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.04,0:06:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you the new transfer student?\NI'm Shido Itsuki. Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.17,0:06:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,He looks awfully like Boy...\NJust a coincidence?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.89,0:06:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so funny, Nia.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.85,0:06:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa! He spoke my name?!\NAnd it sounded so natural, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.40,0:06:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Games sure have come far\Nin the past five years!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.69,0:06:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Next Saturday, huh?\NSure. Where should we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.49,0:06:32.12,On Top,,0,0,0,,"Enter your date plans"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.24,0:06:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You're kidding! I can write anything?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.37,0:06:38.87,On Top,,0,0,0,,"Enter your date plans"\N"I wanna buy doujinshi in Akiba"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.45,0:06:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way this works.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.87,0:06:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Doujinshi in Akiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.13,0:06:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That's so like you. It's a date.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.42,0:06:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This dialogue! This freedom!\NAre games really this advanced?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.18,0:06:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Science is fricken' awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.60,0:07:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? You like these kinda books?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.10,0:07:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's all good. I think\Nhaving passions is a wonderful thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.28,0:07:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,She's played for two hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.57,0:07:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Happiness is rising steadily.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.57,0:07:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Once Nia's done with the game,\NShido can appear before her as "Itsuki."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.58,0:07:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Seeing how it's really him,\Nthere's nothing to screw up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.96,0:07:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah... Incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.46,0:07:34.97,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's just a demo,\Nso I'll have to buy the real version.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.01,0:07:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Has this publisher made anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.22,0:07:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll just ask Raziel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.19,0:07:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.57,0:07:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.49,0:07:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Grr! This was all your doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.86,0:07:57.95,On Top,,0,0,0,,"Emergency Meeting"\N"How to make Nia Honjo fall for Shido!?"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.70,0:07:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, now we've really pissed her off.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.95,0:08:04.33,On Top,,0,0,0,,"Tohka Yatogami"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.24,0:08:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not surprised. You guys used\Na fake game to basically spy on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.58,0:08:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Shido. Why does Nia only like 2D?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.21,0:08:19.22,On Top,,0,0,0,,"Kotori Itsuka"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.34,0:08:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.55,0:08:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I wondered that, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.47,0:08:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Reine is checking if\Nshe had any manga artist pals.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.60,0:08:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Suggestion. Shouldn't we just\Nmake Shido suit her preferences?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.15,0:08:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We're talking 2D, though.\NShould we flatten him with a steamroller?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.94,0:08:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.49,0:08:37.20,On Top,,0,0,0,,"Natsumi"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.78,0:08:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, what if I made him\Ninto a manga page with Haniel?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.45,0:08:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold your horses! Making me 2D is nuts!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.99,0:08:47.00,On Top,,0,0,0,,"Origami Tobiichi"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.33,0:08:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I think Natsumi has the right idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.12,0:08:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's put Shido on a page.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.00,0:08:53.26,On Top,,0,0,0,,"Emergency Meeting"\N"How to make Nia Honjo fall for Shido!?"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.04,0:08:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,--What?\N--Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.25,0:08:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Though, not by\Ntransforming Shido himself,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.96,0:08:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,but by making a manga\Nwhere Shido is a character.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.76,0:08:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Wha--?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.80,0:09:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I see! That's a way of making him 2D!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.77,0:09:07.15,On Top,,0,0,0,,"Yuzuru Yamai"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.89,0:09:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm! It'll be fine as long as\Nwe write stuff that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.15,0:09:16.28,On Top,,0,0,0,,"Yoshino"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.52,0:09:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. If Nia knows about\Neverything Shido's done for us,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.90,0:09:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure she'll end up liking Shido, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.53,0:09:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Really, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.28,0:09:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh! Shido in a manga!\NThat's awesome! I wanna help!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.75,0:09:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Agreement. After tying in our 39th match,\N"Best Manga Submission,"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.42,0:09:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,the two of us are due\Nto put our skills back to the test.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.46,0:09:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys sure compete over everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.01,0:09:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,The outside line? I wonder who it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.93,0:09:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo! Plotting something, are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.10,0:09:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I had Raziel tell me about this line...\Nand about what you're planning.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.69,0:09:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, even if you do make a manga,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.15,0:10:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,why do you just assume that I'll read it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.74,0:10:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I might've taken a look at it before,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.50,0:10:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,but you guys have put me in "angry mode."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.08,0:10:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,With Comico coming up,\NI can't waste my time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.17,0:10:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Comico? You're entering Comico?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.72,0:10:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup. My first in five years.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.22,0:10:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Miku, what's Comico?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.14,0:10:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Comic Colosseum.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.81,0:10:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a convention for people\Nto sell the doujinshi they make.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.69,0:10:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,If our manga was worth reading,\Nwould you take the time to read it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.15,0:10:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.36,0:10:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,For example, if our manga manages\Nto sell more copies than yours at Comico.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.08,0:10:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? You're actually serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.20,0:10:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. If we end up winning,\Nyou have to read our manga.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.63,0:10:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay! You're on!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.05,0:11:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You think you can beat\NSouji Honjo, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.10,0:11:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Hey, Kotori...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.89,0:11:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I've got a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.69,0:11:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,They underestimate me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.57,0:11:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,They really think they can beat a pro?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.45,0:11:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Regardless of what happens, it's not like\NI could like a real person anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.67,0:11:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, it's not like\Nanyone would like me, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.01,0:11:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the all-knowing Angel,\NRaziel, is it not?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.94,0:12:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you, Nia Honjo.\NMy name is Kurumi Tokisaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.33,0:12:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Kurumi Tokisaki,\Nthe Spirit who manipulates time...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.79,0:12:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. You're the one\Nwho saved me from DEM.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.01,0:12:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That saves an explanation.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.84,0:12:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the second Spirit\Nseen after the "Spirit of Origin."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.01,0:12:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been longing to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.35,0:12:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm? And why's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.98,0:12:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,No need to be on your guard.\NI just came to ask a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.90,0:12:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you look into something with Raziel?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.95,0:12:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me about the Spirit of Origin...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.45,0:12:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,...and how to kill it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.96,0:13:02.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa! This is neat!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.55,0:13:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so "professional."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.26,0:13:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Comico's in two days.\NCan we do it in time?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.55,0:13:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll have to.\NLet's see how well everyone draws.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.06,0:13:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You draw something, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.06,0:13:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.11,0:13:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't you use to sketch all the time?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.86,0:13:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The Black Knight, Lievan, or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.44,0:13:28.32,On Top,,0,0,0,,"The Black Knight, Lievan"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.50,0:13:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're done drawing, let's see it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.71,0:13:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I see... Yeah, very cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.71,0:13:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.05,0:13:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but I don't think\Nit'll work for us this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.43,0:13:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.68,0:13:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,S-Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.39,0:13:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Next one! Next!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.73,0:13:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,No fair, Darling!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.73,0:14:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa! You guys are pretty good!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.11,0:14:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,So far, you two are our\Nbest candidates. So, who's next?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.20,0:14:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you draw, Origami?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.95,0:14:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Shido and me, becoming one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.50,0:14:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,No one asked you to draw that!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.83,0:14:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,If we're trying to sell doujinshi,\Ngoing 18+ is the way to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.13,0:14:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We're entering as\Na "General Audience" booth, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.68,0:14:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up? If you drew something,\Nlet's see it. C'mon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.77,0:14:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, it's bad, so don't expect much.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.52,0:14:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't sleep well last night,\Nand I haven't drawn in forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.57,0:14:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, fine. Just show us already!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.45,0:14:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Incredible, Natsumi!\NWho knew you had such skill?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.37,0:14:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I wouldn't say "skill."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.21,0:15:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,But I did imitate\Na manga artist once, just for fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.17,0:15:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That settles it!\NNatsumi's our main artist.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.26,0:15:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,With Yuzuru, Kaguya, Shido,\Nand Origami supporting her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.72,0:15:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.39,0:15:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,A-Are you really fine with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.10,0:15:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course! We need your talent\Nto help Nia, Natsumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.36,0:15:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't complain about it later.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.11,0:15:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Kotori, what can the rest of us do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.11,0:15:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I have another job for you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.03,0:15:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,In a way, it's more important\Nthan the manga.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.91,0:15:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.67,0:15:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.05,0:15:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That's troubling news.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.64,0:15:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you suppose we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.06,0:16:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed. According to what\NRaziel had to say,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.98,0:16:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,even if I gather Spirit power, I stand\Nno chance against the Spirit of Origin.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.82,0:16:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.44,0:16:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,...what does it matter anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.91,0:16:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the Spirit with power over time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.87,0:16:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The notion of time makes\Neverything else insignificant.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.50,0:16:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Gah! Messed up the grid.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.92,0:16:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Geh! The tears are invading the white!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.67,0:16:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Likewise. The ink spread under the ruler.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.55,0:16:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay. This can be fixed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.14,0:16:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Shido, got a minute?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.40,0:16:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Hiroki Takajo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.48,0:16:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The manga artist!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.36,0:16:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. Looking into Nia's--that is,\NSouji Honjo's friends, led me to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.20,0:17:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I hear you guys are relatives of Honjo's?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.62,0:17:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. We're worried since\Nwe're having trouble contacting Nia.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.21,0:17:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,So, we're hoping you can share\Nanything you know about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.05,0:17:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly, I've been\Nworried about her, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.01,0:17:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I was glad to hear that\Nshe's back to making manga,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.60,0:17:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,but since it seems that she\Ndoesn't like me, I'm not sure I can help.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.69,0:17:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,--Huh?\N--Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.86,0:17:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,At one time, she and I\Nused to get along well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.78,0:17:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,But then she suddenly acted cold\Nand we drifted apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.37,0:17:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps I did something rude\Nto her without knowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.66,0:17:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Honjo is a kind and friendly person,\Nbut as for her life before an artist...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.75,0:17:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,She rarely spoke about\Nthe friends she had in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.97,0:18:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,And I feel like she suddenly distances\Nherself from any friends in the making.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.85,0:18:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,If only I knew what I did to upset her,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.98,0:18:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd take that chance to apologize, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.07,0:18:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet Raziel played a part in this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.74,0:18:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,If you had the power to know anything,\Nyou'd look up those around you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.25,0:18:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,True...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.62,0:18:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That probably made Nia\Nunable to trust other people.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.46,0:18:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone's said or done mean things\Nbehind people's backs to some extent.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.26,0:18:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd realize how\Npathetic people are in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.35,0:18:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,She only opens her heart to 2D\Nbecause she knows they won't betray her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.94,0:18:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That's--
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.98,0:18:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,--You think that's all it is?\N--Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.82,0:18:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Raziel shows her people's dark side.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.36,0:19:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,But knowing Nia's personality,\NI feel like she'd look past that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.08,0:19:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, let's focus on the doujinshi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.12,0:19:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,We need another chance to talk with Nia.\NWithout that, we'll get nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.68,0:19:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally! Page 57 is done!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.44,0:19:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I just finished 58, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.15,0:19:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I, whom only hurricanes can subdue,\Nhave finished the last page!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.49,0:19:42.86,OS,,0,0,0,,"Don't worry about it. Besides, we'd have\Nbeen in trouble if you hadn't come."\N"Hey, Natsumi."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.16,0:19:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Gather. I'll scan all our pages\Nand make it digital.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.04,0:19:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,With editing and printing,\Nit's gonna be a close one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.46,0:19:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Good work, Shido.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.75,0:20:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You look exhausted, too.\NWhat have you been up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.43,0:20:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a secret, Shido.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.60,0:20:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Look forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.22,0:20:11.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Natsumi?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.73,0:20:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Natsumi, how about a break?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.02,0:20:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.36,0:20:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Swap out. You've been working non-stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.20,0:20:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's fine. I'm almost done.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.12,0:20:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You did the storyboard, draft,\Nand worked harder than anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.04,0:20:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right. The convention is\Nthe real battle. Leave the rest to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.96,0:20:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Agreed. You've worked\Nway too hard, Natsumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.84,0:20:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Rest is important, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.30,0:20:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay. I won't be\Nthat much use at the convention.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.06,0:20:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,This is about all I can do, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.48,0:20:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.06,0:21:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, I'm really glad\NI was saved by all of you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.65,0:21:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,This time, I can do my part\Nto help another Spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.45,0:21:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That really... really makes me happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.29,0:21:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,So, this is nothing.\NI wanna show that dummy Nia, too:
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.83,0:21:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That friends are a wonderful thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.46,0:21:25.97,On Top,,0,0,0,,"H-Hey, Natsumi?"
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.09,0:21:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's... the last... one.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.60,0:21:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Natsumi?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.39,0:21:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Good work, Natsumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.48,0:21:40.73,OS,,0,0,0,,"Dummies..."\N"*W-Waaah*"\N"H-Hey, Natsumi?"
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.65,0:21:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we have our weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.03,0:21:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys, we've gotta win, no matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.24,0:21:55.00,On Top,,0,0,0,,"Episode 02:\N'So Be It! 2D It Is!'"
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.99,0:21:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, shall we begin our date?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.71,0:23:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The doujinshi convention\Nis a battle of passion!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.55,0:23:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The love and fervor of artists\Nheats up the winter cold!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.60,0:23:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time: "What's Yours Is Mine."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.85,0:23:41.54,On Top,,0,0,0,,"Episode 03: 'What's Yours Is Mine.'"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.85,0:23:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Westcott's intentions are finally known.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.49,0:23:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.48,0:23:45.50,On Top,,0,0,0,,
